 "about": "Expressive voice-overs: Chatterbox by Resemble AI (MIT). Turbo reads English with real sounds and moods; Multilingual reads 23 languages, with intensity. Both copy a voice from a short recording. Files are pinned to a revision and checked by sha256. Multilingual's own audio decoder takes 45 s to load; Turbo's (a distilled one for the same speech tokens) reads its tokens just as well (Whisper hears the same words, the voice matches at 0.90) in a fraction of the time, so only Turbo's is downloaded.",
